     "type": "text",
     "text": "小艾：$8.5^2=(8+0.5)^2=8^2+2\\times8\\times0.5+0.5^2$"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "小平：$8.5^2=\\left(\\dfrac{17}{2}\\right)^2=\\dfrac{17^2}{4^2}$"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "阿榮：$8.5^2=8^2+0.5^2$"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "阿花：$8.5^2=(9-0.5)^2=9^2-2\\times9\\times0.5-0.5^2$"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "如果這四人接下來都沒有計算或其他方面的錯誤，那麼誰的答案是正確的？"
